  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 529.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to establish the criteria and procedures for transfers of involuntarily admitted persons between designated receiving facilities in the developmental services system.\n\nSource. #6216, eff 3-30-96, EXPIRED: 12-31-98\n\nNew. #7090, eff 8-31-99, EXPIRED: 8-31-07\n\nNew. #9062, eff 1-3-08; ss by #11009, INTERIM, eff 1-3-16, EXPIRES: 7-1-16; ss by #11125, eff 7-1-16",
